        <body>
            <div xml:id="d19">

                <pb facs="0110" n="20" xml:id="pg20"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890b.6363 Gulf Oil Corporation/159:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain (Mellon) to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-10-18T11:00:00+00:00">October 18, 1932—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 18—6:51 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>298. I presented views outlined in your 258, October 4, 6 p.m., yesterday to
                        Vansittart and urged early
                    action.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Mellon</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
